  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Hey, there seems to be that a lot of countries lack either a flag or a coat of arms in the page. I think it would be a good idea to use these as placeholders: \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/57/Placeholder_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20171213191610\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Placeholder Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/57/Placeholder_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20171213191610\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"120\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Placeholder Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Placeholder_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Placeholder_Flag.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 125px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/94/Placeholder_Coat_of_Arms.png/revision/latest?cb=20171213191640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Placeholder Coat of Arms\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/94/Placeholder_Coat_of_Arms.png/revision/latest?cb=20171213191640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Placeholder Coat of Arms.png\" data-image-key=\"Placeholder_Coat_of_Arms.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Placeholder_Coat_of_Arms.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t</figcaption> </figure><p>&lt;ac_metadata title=\"Idea\"&gt; &lt;/ac_metada